Yesterday my Lvl 14 Wiz killed Croesus - only second character to do
so, and the first to survive the experience. She opened the vault
door, admired all the piles of $, then walked out. The only Priest I
found so far was in Minetown, and he is long dead, so no reason to lug
the gold around. If I am going to stash it anyway, Fort Ludios is as
good a place as any.

Yet sooner or later I expect to find another Priest, and will have to
come back to Fort Ludios. What is the best way to avoid traps? My
Wizard is already fire-resistant and poison-resistant, so perhaps no
additional preparations are even needed. Pit traps can be annoying
however, so I am thinking of polymorphing into a vampire lord (I have
Polycontrol ring) when it is time to clean the place out. Vampires
levitate over pits, yet can pick things off the ground. What do you
think?



